Error [E-OSTARGET-MIXED-AXIS]: `#Target(OS.Linux)` can't combine with `#Target(Wasm)` on `LinuxBackend.Backend`
  --> tests/ui/os_target_mixed_axis.jet:12:6
    |
 12 | impl LinuxBackend.Backend {
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The OS axis (OS.Linux/OS.MacOS/OS.Windows, native platform gating) and the web axis (Wasm/JS/Web, the browser partition) are mutually exclusive — one item can't compile for both a specific native OS and a web bucket
 Fix: Pick one axis: remove the `#Target(OS.Linux)` marker or the web-axis marker
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E-OSTARGET-MIXED-AXIS
